233	    /** A person's due-total: the sum of the figures of their claims that count, at most the sheet's
234	     *  cap in force on its today; null (n/a) when their grade on the sheet's today has no rate on it and no counting claim
235	     *  has a figure (one fixed, or a live due at the grade in force on its date). */
236	    public BigDecimal dueTotal(String sheetId, Person person, List<Claim> theirs) {
237	        return dueTotal(now(sheetId), person, theirs);
238	    }
